## Vendored research code — src_algo/statescope/vendor/

Slimmed and modernised ports, kept under their original licences:

* `vendor/e2usd/` — E2USD (Lai et al., WWW 2024)
  https://github.com/AI4CTS/E2USD
  The DDEM network and FNCC loss follow the authors' reference implementation.

* `vendor/issd/` — ISSD (Wang et al., SIGMOD 2025)
  https://github.com/Lab-ANT/ISSD
  Completeness-first and quality-first channel selection.

The detector pipeline (encode, DPGMM, vote) also follows Time2State
(Wang et al., SIGMOD 2023) — https://github.com/Lab-ANT/Time2State

PCMCI+ is used through the `tigramite` package (Runge et al.), which is
GPL-3.0 licensed and is an optional dependency installed by the user; no
tigramite code is included in this repository.

## Vendored data — data_origin/petshop/

The PetShop Dataset (Hardt, Kirschbaum et al., CLeaR 2024)
https://github.com/amazon-science/petshop-root-cause-analysis
Code Apache-2.0; data CC-BY-4.0. Only a subset is included; see
`data_origin/petshop/README.md` and the bundled `LICENSE`.

Other datasets (LEMMA-RCA, WADI) are not redistributed here. See
`data_origin/*/README.md` for how to obtain them and under which terms.
